In this case, the points are $(-3, -4)$ and $(4, -5)$, so the distance is $\sqrt{(4-(-3))^2 + (-5-(-4))^2} = \sqrt{7^2 + (-1)^2} = \sqrt{49+1} = \sqrt{50} = \boxed{5\sqrt{2}}$.
