We can write
\[\frac{1}{x_k + 1} = \frac{1}{x_{k - 1}^2 + x_{k - 1} + 1} = \frac{1}{(x_{k - 1} + 1)(x_{k - 1})} = \frac{x_{k - 1}}{(x_{k - 1} + 1)(x_{k - 1})} = \frac{1}{x_{k - 1} + 1} - \frac{1}{x_{k - 1}}.\]Therefore,
